{"ID":"20240205153653-4ltq24q","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153653-4ltq24q","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153653-4ltq24q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205171835-bza89wt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614125819-e6vf148\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2746,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614130248-ur6inh6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"381补24白前","type":"doc","updated":"20240828161602"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205171835-bza89wt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205171835-bza89wt","updated":"20240205171854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【產地】\t主產河南、遼寧、河北、山西、山東、陝西、新疆等北方地區。\n【性狀】\t根纖細彎曲扭轉而成團狀，長約110cm，多數呈毛須狀，表面棕色或紫棕色，有細繳皺，並具多數小鬚根。根莖呈管狀，細長有節，略彎曲，長約415cm，直徑1.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5mm，表面淺黃色至黃棕色，有細縱皺紋，節部膨大，常有分歧，並密生鬚根，頂端常殘留灰綠色或紫棕色的地上莖；質堅脆，易折斷，斷面類圓形，中空或有膜質的髓。質堅脆，易折斷，斷面類白色，氣微弱，味甜。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，微溫。\n【功效】\t降氣化痰，止咳。用於咳嗽痰多，氣喘。該品性微溫而不燥烈，長於祛痰，降肺氣以平咳喘，無論屬寒屬熱，外感內傷，新嗽久咳均可用之"}]},{"ID":"20240205171838-prfqpbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205171838-prfqpbl","updated":"20240205171838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205171838-xal89kq.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163718-sufzkv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163718-sufzkv5","updated":"20240205163718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 553px;","style":"width: 543px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白前"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白前-20240205163718-aph8uzn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 543px;\" parent-style=\"width: 553px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 466px;","style":"width: 456px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白前2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白前2-20240205163718-x7h1fmk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 456px;\" parent-style=\"width: 466px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705132206-ijwkk0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705132206-ijwkk0q","updated":"20240705134554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 515px;","style":"width: 505px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白前"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白前-20240705132206-0lt747v.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 505px;\" parent-style=\"width: 515px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 343px;","style":"width: 333px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"柳叶白前"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/柳叶白前-20240705134538-6j6sonf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 333px;\" parent-style=\"width: 343px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type"